            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Tempura Kubara",
            "review_text": "YSKing\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam269 contributions\n0\n出汁屋経営の天ぷら屋\nOct 2018 • Friends\nホーチミンで本格的な天ぷらを提供しているお店です。\n高島屋には同じ経営の鍋レストランがあります。\nお店の作りが少し特徴的です。\n個人的には高島屋にある鍋レストランの方が使い勝手もよくおススメです。\n\nThis restaurant offers authentic tempura in Ho Chi Minh City.\nTakashimaya has a pot restaurant with the same management.\nThe design of the shop is a bit distinctive.\nPersonally, the convenience of the Nabe restaurant in Takashimaya is also recommended.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 3, 2019",
