            "review_title": "Review at Tempura Kubara",
            "review_text": "Kate HP\nBrisbane, Australia33 contributions\n0\nDelicious fresh Tempura Lunch\nMay 2018\nI’ve been twice for the set lunch and it was delicious both times. The set includes rice, miso soup, radish and a unique selection of pickles. The tempura is the lightest of light and cooked to order, with a staggered delivery as it is cooked. Service was excellent both times I visited.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 1, 2018",
