            "review_text": "EatDrinknbMarried\nMelbourne, Australia470 contributions\n1\nExcellent tempura in classic Japanese setting\nMay 2018 • Couples\nWe were so happy to find this spot in a quieter area of tree lined street. It’s very Japanese inside with the bar counter and chef making delicious tempura right there. Great cold sake, including their own brand of Junmaidaiginjo which was excellent, and the tempura eel, shrimp, white fish, lotus root, etc...all great. Highly recommend\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 1, 2018",
